    "steam_appid": 3209630,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209630/extras/ce0a5cf74e1d795d412e72df56d785a5.avif?t=1726166335\" width=610 height=120 /></span><br><br><strong>Repair, Paint, Sell - together!</strong><br><br>&quot;Junkyard Treasure Together&quot; begins in a scrapyard, but the adventure doesn't end there! In this four-player co-op game, team up with your friends to take a beat-up junk car and turn it into a masterpiece. Your mission is simple: repair, paint, polish, and sell your way to profit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209630/extras/74420f3660b6a62c6c4bf3b7244402d6.webp?t=1726166335\" width=610 height=62 /></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Teamwork:</strong> Join forces with up to four players and combine your skills to form the ultimate repair crew.<br></li><li><strong>Detailed Repair Mechanics:</strong> Strip down the engine, replace parts, fix the bodywork, and restore the car to its former glory.<br></li><li><strong>Personalize Your Ride:</strong> Add your unique touch with a variety of paint and polish options.<br></li><li><strong>Profit Strategy:</strong> Make a profit on each car you flip and upgrade your tools and equipment.<br></li><li><strong>Race Against Time:</strong> Be quick and outbid your competitors to snag the best cars first!</li></ul><br>Are you ready for a fun-filled repair adventure with your friends? What starts in the scrapyard could turn into pure gold with your creativity!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209630/extras/ce0a5cf74e1d795d412e72df56d785a5.avif?t=1726166335\" width=610 height=120 /></span><br><br><strong>Repair, Paint, Sell - together!</strong><br><br>&quot;Junkyard Treasure Together&quot; begins in a scrapyard, but the adventure doesn't end there! In this four-player co-op game, team up with your friends to take a beat-up junk car and turn it into a masterpiece. Your mission is simple: repair, paint, polish, and sell your way to profit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209630/extras/74420f3660b6a62c6c4bf3b7244402d6.webp?t=1726166335\" width=610 height=62 /></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Teamwork:</strong> Join forces with up to four players and combine your skills to form the ultimate repair crew.<br></li><li><strong>Detailed Repair Mechanics:</strong> Strip down the engine, replace parts, fix the bodywork, and restore the car to its former glory.<br></li><li><strong>Personalize Your Ride:</strong> Add your unique touch with a variety of paint and polish options.<br></li><li><strong>Profit Strategy:</strong> Make a profit on each car you flip and upgrade your tools and equipment.<br></li><li><strong>Race Against Time:</strong> Be quick and outbid your competitors to snag the best cars first!</li></ul><br>Are you ready for a fun-filled repair adventure with your friends? What starts in the scrapyard could turn into pure gold with your creativity!",
